            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f4" n="4" xml:id="d145-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d137-f4">footnote 4, Document 137</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f5" n="5" xml:id="d145-f5-content">
                <p>King Constantine’s marriage to Princess Anne
                        Marie of Denmark was to take place September 18.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
